h2. Summary

The cart *total* is off by one cent for _some_ currencies.

Steps:
# Add two items priced at {{1.005}}
# Go to checkout
# Observe the rounded total

See the [rounding helper|https://example.com/docs/rounding] and this snippet:

{code:java}
BigDecimal total = subtotal.setScale(2, RoundingMode.HALF_UP);
{code}

bq. Reported by finance during the July close.

----

*Workaround:* apply the fix in {{PriceFormatter}}.
